# False positives for the link checker.

# Documentation references localhost, not a reachable host.
http://localhost
https://localhost
http://127.0.0.1
https://127.0.0.1

# Slack requires an authenticated session, so the checker always sees a redirect.
https://owasp.slack.com/

# GitHub rate-limits the checker on anchors into repository file trees.
https://github.com/OWASP/DecodeBox/security/advisories/new

# Anchors generated by the OWASP Jekyll site theme, outside our control.
https://groups.google.com/a/owasp.com/
